---
import '../styles/hyrox-theme.css';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>subninety.club — What HYROX racing actually looks like</title>
<meta name="description" content="Race reports and analysis of HYROX racing built from real athlete data — heart rate, calorie burn, cadence, recovery. Every chart is one athlete's hardware in one race; every conclusion has its data.">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://subninety.club/" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght,SOFT,WONK@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,700;9..144,900&family=Inter+Tight:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebSite",
  "name": "subninety.club",
  "url": "https://subninety.club/",
  "description": "Race reports &amp; analysis. Race reports and analysis built from real athlete data.",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Prashant Singh"
  }
}
</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Person",
  "name": "Prashant Singh",
  "jobTitle": "HYROX athlete and writer",
  "description": "HYROX athlete in age group 30\u201334, Bengaluru. Race time 02:01:06 at HYROX Bengaluru 2026.",
  "url": "https://subninety.club/"
}
</script>

<style>
:root {
  --bg: #0A0A0B;
  --surface: #14141A;
  --panel: #1A1A22;
  --ink-1: #F5F5EE;
  --ink-2: #A0A09A;
  --ink-3: #5C5C58;
  --rule: #26262C;
  --yellow: #FFE600;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink-1); }
body {
  font-family: 'Inter Tight', system-ui, sans-serif;
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  font-feature-settings: "ss01" on, "cv11" on;
}
a { color: inherit; }

.wrap { max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 24px 96px; }

/* Site header */
.site-header {
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  padding-bottom: 24px;
  margin-bottom: 96px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 24px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.wordmark {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 28px;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  font-variation-settings: "SOFT" 50;
  color: var(--ink-1);
}
.wordmark .dot { color: var(--yellow); }
.tagline {
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink-3);
}

/* Mission */
.mission { margin-bottom: 128px; }
.mission-text {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px);
  line-height: 1.05;
  letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  margin: 0 0 28px;
  max-width: 920px;
  color: var(--ink-1);
  font-variation-settings: "SOFT" 50;
}
.mission-text em {
  font-style: italic;
  font-variation-settings: "SOFT" 100, "WONK" 1;
  color: var(--yellow);
  font-weight: 400;
}
.mission-sub {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-weight: 400;
  font-size: clamp(20px, 1.8vw, 24px);
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--ink-2);
  max-width: 760px;
  margin: 0 0 44px;
  font-variation-settings: "SOFT" 100, "opsz" 32;
}
.author-intro {
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink-3);
  padding-top: 24px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 24px;
}
.author-intro strong { color: var(--ink-1); font-weight: 500; }

/* Featured race report card */
.featured { margin-bottom: 96px; }
.featured-card {
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--rule);
  padding: 56px 56px 48px;
  position: relative;
  transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  text-decoration: none;
  color: var(--ink-1);
  display: block;
}
.featured-card:hover { border-color: var(--yellow); }
.card-category {
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--yellow);
  margin-bottom: 24px;
  font-weight: 500;
}
.featured-card .card-title {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 44px);
  line-height: 1.05;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  margin: 0 0 20px;
  max-width: 820px;
  font-variation-settings: "SOFT" 50;
  color: var(--ink-1);
}
.featured-card .card-title em {
  font-style: italic;
  font-variation-settings: "SOFT" 100, "WONK" 1;
  color: var(--yellow);
  font-weight: 400;
}
.featured-card .card-lede {
  color: var(--ink-2);
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.55;
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 0 0 40px;
}
.card-stats {
  display: flex;
  gap: 56px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  padding: 24px 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  margin-bottom: 28px;
}
.card-stats .stat .num {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 32px;
  line-height: 1;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  display: block;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  color: var(--ink-1);
}
.card-stats .stat .num .unit { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-3); font-weight: 400; margin-left: 2px; }
.card-stats .stat .lbl {
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink-3);
  margin-top: 8px;
  display: block;
}
.card-link {
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--yellow);
  font-weight: 500;
}

/* Analysis grid */
.analysis { margin-bottom: 96px; }
.section-header { margin-bottom: 36px; }
.section-header h2 {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 32px;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  margin: 0 0 8px;
  color: var(--ink-1);
}
.section-header p {
  font-family: 'Inter Tight', sans-serif;
  font-size: 17px;
  color: var(--ink-2);
  margin: 0;
}

.grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(340px, 1fr));
  gap: 24px;
}
.grid .card {
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--rule);
  padding: 32px;
  text-decoration: none;
  color: var(--ink-1);
  display: block;
  transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
}
.grid .card:hover { border-color: var(--yellow); }
.grid .card .card-title {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 22px;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  margin: 0 0 12px;
  line-height: 1.2;
  color: var(--ink-1);
}
.grid .card .card-lede {
  color: var(--ink-2);
  font-size: 15.5px;
  line-height: 1.55;
  margin: 0 0 24px;
}
.card-meta {
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink-3);
  padding-top: 16px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
}

/* In production */
.coming {
  margin-bottom: 96px;
  padding: 40px 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
}
.coming h2 {
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--yellow);
  font-weight: 500;
  margin: 0 0 16px;
}
.coming > p {
  color: var(--ink-2);
  margin: 0 0 24px;
  font-size: 16px;
  max-width: 720px;
}
.coming ul {
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0 0 16px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(360px, 1fr));
  gap: 8px;
}
.coming li {
  padding: 12px 0 12px 20px;
  border-left: 2px solid var(--rule);
  color: var(--ink-1);
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.5;
}
.coming li strong {
  color: var(--ink-1);
  font-weight: 500;
}
.coming li .meta {
  display: block;
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink-3);
  margin-top: 2px;
}
.coming .schedule {
  color: var(--ink-3);
  font-size: 12.5px;
  margin: 24px 0 0;
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

/* Footer */
.site-footer {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  padding-top: 36px;
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  color: var(--ink-3);
  line-height: 1.7;
}

/* Mobile */
@media (max-width: 720px) {
  .wrap { padding: 48px 18px 64px; }
  .site-header { flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 56px; }
  .mission { margin-bottom: 72px; }
  .featured-card { padding: 32px 24px; }
  .card-stats { gap: 32px; }
  .featured, .analysis, .coming { margin-bottom: 64px; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wordmark">subninety<span class="dot">.</span>club</div>
    <div class="tagline">Race reports &amp; analysis</div>
  </header>

  <section class="mission">
    <h1 class="mission-text">
      What HYROX racing actually looks like, from <em>one athlete's data</em>.
    </h1>
    <p class="mission-sub">
      Every chart on this site comes from one athlete&#8217;s hardware in one race.
      Every conclusion shows its data.
    </p>
    <div class="author-intro">
      <span>By <strong>Prashant Singh</strong></span>
      <span>Age group <strong>30&ndash;34</strong></span>
      <span>Based in <strong>Bengaluru</strong></span>
      <span>HYROX BLR 2026 finish &nbsp;<strong>02:01:06</strong></span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="featured">
    <a class="featured-card" href="/hyrox-bengaluru-2026/">
      <div class="card-category">FEATURED RACE REPORT</div>
      <h2 class="card-title">
        What does <em>heart rate</em> look like during a HYROX race?
      </h2>
      <p class="card-lede">
        1,157 heart rate samples from a 2:01:06 finish in Bengaluru &mdash; mapped to all 16
        segments, decomposed into zones, drift, and recovery. Five charts, one race, one body.
      </p>
      <div class="card-stats">
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="num">92<span class="unit">%</span></span>
          <span class="lbl">Time at threshold+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="num">1,157</span>
          <span class="lbl">HR samples</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="num">189<span class="unit">bpm</span></span>
          <span class="lbl">Peak heart rate</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="num">2:01:06</span>
          <span class="lbl">Total race time</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="card-link">Read the full report &rarr;</span>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="analysis">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>Recent analysis</h2>
      <p>Focused deep-dives, one chart each, each answering one question.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">
      <a href="/hyrox-calories-burned/" class="card">
        <div class="card-category">ANALYSIS</div>
        <h3 class="card-title">How many calories does HYROX burn?</h3>
        <p class="card-lede">
          1,441 kcal across 2 hours. The longest two segments &mdash; Wall Balls and Sled Pull
          &mdash; cost more than the highest-HR runs. Duration beats intensity for total burn.
        </p>
        <div class="card-meta">22 May 2026 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Calorie cost</div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="coming">
    <h2>In production</h2>
    <p>Five more analyses being prepared from the same race data, publishing weekly:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>HR + cadence overlay</strong>
        <span class="meta">What the body was actually doing, minute by minute</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Heart rate recovery curves</strong>
        <span class="meta">The 90 seconds after each station</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Run pace and pacing strategy</strong>
        <span class="meta">How each of the 8 runs compared</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Time allocation</strong>
        <span class="meta">Running, stations, and transitions, broken down</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Watch vs chip-mat timing</strong>
        <span class="meta">A cadence-validated accuracy story</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p class="schedule">New analysis every Sunday &middot; check back, or RSS coming soon</p>
  </section>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    subninety.club &copy; 2026 Prashant Singh.<br />
    Built on Astro &middot; Hosted on Cloudflare Pages &middot; Data from Apple Watch and HYROX official results.
  </footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>